@startuml
title Redis Pub/Sub WebSocket Management - Component Diagram

actor User

component "WebSocket Application\n(App Service)" as App <<application>>
component "Worker Application\n(Worker App)"   as Worker <<application>>
component "Manager Service"                    as Manager <<service>>
database "Redis Cluster\n(ZSet, List, String, Pub/Sub)" as Redis <<database>>
node "WebSocket Endpoint"                      as WS <<component>>

User --> WS : open/close\nmessages
WS --> App : delegate\nWebSocket events

App --> Redis : SET session:{sessionId}\nZADD queue\nRPUSH waiting:{userId}
App --> Manager : register(appId)\nheartbeat

Manager --> Redis : GET/DEL app:{appId}\nZRANGE queue\nSETNX lock:{userId}:{workerId}\nRPUSH connections:{userId}\nPUBLISH {userId}
Manager --> App   : pingHealth()
App     --> Manager : pong

Worker --> Redis : SUBSCRIBE {userId} (Pub/Sub)
Worker --> Redis : LPOP connections:{userId}
Manager --> Worker : signaling notification (via Pub/Sub)
Worker --> App     : signalingOffer(userId, workerId)

@enduml
